    "text": "TELEVISIONWhat time does the Oscars red carpet start? How to watch Bebe HodgesCincinnati EnquirerUpdated March 15, 2026, 4:55 p.m. ETThe Oscars is one of the biggest nights in fashion, giving viewers a glimpse into what to expect from luxury fashion houses.The 98th Academy Awards take place Sunday, March 15. But before the best picture can be crowned, nominees will line the red carpet in gorgeous gowns and suits.This year will likely be different from recent Oscar ceremonies. Items from the archives have dominated the red carpet in the last couple years, as a slew of creative director changes stunted the showcase of new designs.If you purchase through our links, the USA Today Network may earn a commission. Prices were accurate at the time of publication but may change.",
